<title>UK: BayerVB sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets NZ$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion and Bayerische Vereinsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    17.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.835   PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
